    "text": "waovam.com\nwebsite\nKnox County, Indiana\nKnox County Sports Roundup for Tuesday\nBy Tom Zimmerman,\n1 days agoThe Lincoln boys’ soccer team blanked Vincennes Rivet 3-0. Morgan Horst, Lukas Lang, and Claudson Thomas scored the L-H-S goals. The South Knox Varsity evens its record at 7-7 with a 3-0 win over Shakamak. Madison Parish and Janet West led with seven kills apiece. Parish also added 13 points, with12 scored by Braelyn Gladish. Jenna Bluebaum tallied 26digs, and 13 assists from both Makayla Carie and Ava Steffey.",
